WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.523
I couldn't pass because when I was introduced to it, first thing I

00:00:04.523 --> 00:00:05.420
was like,

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:09.279
we have been traveling all our lives. What are you talking about,

00:00:09.279 --> 00:00:12.680
travel coaching? I was telling my significant other

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.600
that was inviting me to this,

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.341
for these coaching sessions, and I was a bit skeptical. But

00:00:20.341 --> 00:00:22.490
nonetheless, I joined.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.360
I joined, and I would say that I wasn't disappointed at all.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.170
Oh, we just learned so much. The planning

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.160
that has to go into travel, because I've never really planned.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.960
I'm the sort of person who would decide to travel tomorrow.

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:42.037
The surprising thing was that learning that equipped me and my

00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:45.784
partner so much that we realized that all the information we were

00:00:45.784 --> 00:00:49.418
being fed, all the knowledge we were gaining, was then suddenly

00:00:49.418 --> 00:00:50.700
going to become

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.090
transferable.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.890
And what I mean by that is that, from one trip to the other,

00:00:55.890 --> 00:01:00.646
it's a template that we use for every other trip, which means we

00:01:00.646 --> 00:01:05.621
have effective planning, we enjoy our trip, we take inventory after

00:01:05.621 --> 00:01:06.850
our trip.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:10.627
Then we repeat. So we are within budget, we are in agreement on

00:01:10.627 --> 00:01:14.403
everything before we go, because if you're going on a trip with

00:01:14.403 --> 00:01:18.239
someone else and you are not on the same page, things can become

00:01:18.239 --> 00:01:19.950
very complex. And so learning

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:22.810
everything that you taught us,

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:27.670
which is planning being the most important part of the travel,

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:30.040
was certainly very useful to me.

